      "data": {
        "text": "**Developing Core Components**\n\nI've made good progress, creating the initial foundational files: `speech_client.py`, `speech_models.py`, and `synthesize_text.py`. Now, my immediate task is to create the remaining files, starting with `synthesize_ssml.py`, which focuses on SSML synthesis.\n\n\n**Constructing Remaining Files**\n\nI'm now focused on building out the remaining files, after successfully establishing the core. Specifically, I am starting with `synthesize_ssml.py` which will handle SSML synthesis using AWS Polly. This involves voice and prosody controls, similar to my approach for text synthesis, but with SSML input. I have a clear plan for the subsequent files, including voice selection, audio saving, and later stages like translation and safety checks.\n\n\n",
