        "text": "**Defining File Operations**\n\nI'm now creating `save_audio.py` to handle saving the audio stream locally. This meets the requirement of writing synthesized speech to a file, which I've determined is appropriate for this specific scenario. My focus is now on the implementation details and how to make this operational.\n\n\n**Implementing Local Saves**\n\nI'm solidifying the design for `save_audio.py`. This script will directly write the audio byte stream to a local file. Based on the requirements, a local file system operation directly satisfies the \"local file or object\" requirement, therefore this implementation aligns perfectly.\n\n\n",
